WEBVTT

18:02.941 --> 18:05.027
That business with the wolves? Sansa...

18:05.152 --> 18:07.071
I've told you a hundred times -

18:07.196 --> 18:10.115
- a direwolf is not...
- Please shut up about it.

18:11.325 --> 18:13.327
Do you remember your lessons?

18:15.913 --> 18:20.125
- Who built the Iron Throne?
- Aegon the Conqueror.

18:20.250 --> 18:23.796
- And who built the Red Keep?
- Maegor the Cruel.

18:23.921 --> 18:25.714
And how many years
did it take to build...

18:25.839 --> 18:30.177
My grandfather and uncle
were murdered here, weren't they?
